{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","雷光剑影"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","썬더 소드워크"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内进行数次快速攻击，并进入“充盈”状态。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","범위 내에서 빠른 공격을 수차례 진행하며, 활기 상태에 진입한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个格子，对该格子和其周围1格范围内的区域进行7次神速斩击，每次斩击会对区域内的全体敌人造成70% + 10% ATK伤害，且斩击期间自身处于无敌状态。斩击结束后，使自身进入“充盈”状态，持续12秒。在“充盈”状态下，自身提高20%的攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","1개의 칸을 선택해 해당 칸과 그 주변 1칸 범위 내의 구역에 신속한 참격을 7회 시전한다. 참격을 할 때마다 구역 내의 모든 적에게 70% + 10% ATK의 대미지를 입히며, 참격 시간 동안 자신은 무적 상태가 된다. 참격 종료 후 자신은 12초간 활기 상태에 진입하며, 공격력이 20% 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":78,"end":84,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":75,"end":88,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":115,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 75% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 80% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/descr