2名敌人造成同等伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","목표에게 연속 참격을 3회 시전하며, 매회 100% + 10% ATK만큼의 대미지를 입힌다. 활기 상태에서 연속 참격을 할 때마다 갈라진 번개를 일으켜 목표 및 그 주변 2칸 범위 내 최대 2명의 적에게 동일한 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至105% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 105% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至110% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 110% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至115% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 115% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","奔雷怒斩"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","분노의 일격"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","“充盈”状态下才能使用，对周围敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","활기 상태에서 사용할 수 있으며, 주변 적에게 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身处于“充盈”状态时才能使用。释放闪电链，对周围2格范围内的所有敌人造成190% + 20% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","자신이 활기 상태일 때만 사용할 수 있다. 번개 사슬 시전 시 주변 2칸 범위 내 모든 적에게 190% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":57,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":53,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 200% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skill